{
  "case_id": "SHOP-O-1.21.1",
  "title": "卡牌商店·任务O §1.1/§1.2/§1.4：转账面板 2× 回滚（scale=1 ⇒ panel=81,26 逐像素回原）、面板无多余文本（逐键白名单）、星光兑换 60 秒冷却（就绪→兑换→冷却中点击客户端早退不发包）、沙漏 4→1→0 就绪保持",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "card-shop"
  },
  "on_fail": "continue",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "哨兵 788 场景：① 转账面板 2× 回滚全貌（geom 与 calc 双侧 scale=1:panel=81,26）② 面板实际绘制的翻译键白名单（只允许确认键自身文字，禁 cooldown/cooldown_hint）⑤ 星光兑换冷却（cd=0 就绪 → 真实点击兑换 → cd>0 灰态 → 再点 client-side 早退：rej 递增 / 余额与星光不变 / applied=0）⑥ 沙漏 4→1→0 就绪并保持。⑤ 的灰态与按下态由外部 temp/t92/real_cursor_o.ps1 送真实 OS 光标（探针落 evt=o_need_hover_ex 信标后轮询 hoverState 命中 ex=1 再点）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "任务O 788 前置：非亡灵无需求；本场景不买卡，只做静态取证。"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "转账面板需要候选行 ⇒ 用 Carpet 招 4 个假玩家（真 ServerPlayer）当候选。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/carpet allowSpawningOfflinePlayers true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player Bot1 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
