      "command": "/player Bot3 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 250
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player Bot4 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 250
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop reset O",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop star O 20",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal O 788",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "开屏并保持（余额 788 既是探针武装带哨兵也是本场景 gate；界面开着时聊天命令会被 GUI 吞掉，场景内改用 connection.sendCommand 改档）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop openkeep O",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1100
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 180000
    },
